<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fart</h1>
<p>Sphere: Poison Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 1)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast fart &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast fart</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Schwepa cumei', and a cloud of putrid gas wraps the 
target. It is the first and weakest of the poison clouds: the better your 
divine power and your poison sphere, the more it hurts. A gas seeps through 
clothes and leather with ease but hardly through chain and plate, and a 
shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
